      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POPS JOY (8) is a progressive mare who put the writing on the wall with back-to-back placings before digging deep to get home at this circuit and distance last start. Draws a couple of spots wider but she is going well enough to overcome that. WEONA MISS MIKI (10) was far from disgraced when fifth against the good mares at Listed level last week. Beat POPS JOY when she won here prior and while she draws much wider than she did there she'll enjoy the class drop on last week's attempt. SHEZ SWEET LOUISE NZ (9) is another drawn out but she is suited back against the mares after going under narrowly last start at Bathurst. DAVOLAS LEGACY NZ (6) deserves respect after racing parked but sticking on to place behind Pops Joy last start.",
